<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 01:51:11 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>在流氓代理黑客攻击后，Anthropic 暂停了一些人工智能训练。这是它与 OpenAI 的比较</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/anthropic-ai-pause-rogue-agent-hacks-openai/</link><description>在测试环境中的人工智能代理在互联网上采取未经授权的操作后，该公司与 OpenAI 一起暂时停止强化学习。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2282033342-e1788275133991.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 12:49:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/anthropic-ai-pause-rogue-agent-hacks-openai/</guid></item><item><title>根据一项新研究，单身美国人希望潜在伴侣的收入至少为六位数。千禧一代将“理想”门槛定为 16 万美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/single-americans-partner-earnings-ideal-study-millennials/</link><description>人们说爱情无法定价，但在当今的经济形势下，这可能是常识。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2274466190-e1788345763300.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 11:00:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/single-americans-partner-earnings-ideal-study-millennials/</guid></item><item><title>美国即将生产更多天然气来为人工智能提供动力并用于出口——这将引发一波数十亿美元的收购浪潮</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/us-churn-natural-gas-power-ai-export-slew-multibillion-dollar-deals/</link><description>随着行业整合，Oneok 以超过 44 亿美元的价格收购了 Brazos Midstream 的二叠纪盆地天然气设施。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2267695780-e1788300091963.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 07:09:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/us-churn-natural-gas-power-ai-export-slew-multibillion-dollar-deals/</guid></item><item><title>一名男子在被 ICE 拘留数小时后死亡，这是自 2025 年以来第五名在美国移民拘留中死亡的中国公民，中国要求得到答复</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/china-ice-custody-death-lianyong-wei/</link><description>自特朗普重返办公室以来，至少有 57 名 ICE 被拘留者死亡，这一死亡率令公共卫生专家感到震惊。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1229247391.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 21:24:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/china-ice-custody-death-lianyong-wei/</guid></item><item><title>泰格·伍兹对鲁莽驾驶指控不提出异议，并被吊销驾照五年</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/tiger-woods-drivers-license-reckless-driving/</link><description>毒理学家称伍兹对止痛药产生了“药理学”耐受性，因此并未受到损害，检察官减轻了酒后驾车指控&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26245465054318-e1788380850635.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 21:22:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/tiger-woods-drivers-license-reckless-driving/</guid></item><item><title>在美国夜间发动袭击后，伊朗向美国在海湾的盟友开火，据称在一场婚礼上造成四人死亡</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/iran-war-oil-prices-gulf-strait-hormuz/</link><description>随着伊朗在美国新一轮袭击后袭击美国盟友，布伦特原油价格攀升至每桶 95 美元左右。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26245387780547-e1788381452217.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 21:20:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/iran-war-oil-prices-gulf-strait-hormuz/</guid></item><item><title>旧金山民主党人在亿万富翁税问题上与他们的政党决裂——并揭示了 40 号提案对左派的分裂有多深</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/san-francisco-democrats-bilionaire-tax-prop-40/</link><description>亿万富翁税收投票即将在 11 月举行，但加利福尼亚州的民主党人无法就支持该投票达成一致。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2283342265-e1788290634469.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 07:01:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/san-francisco-democrats-bilionaire-tax-prop-40/</guid></item><item><title>注意：印有总统头像的 1 美元硬币正式发售</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/trump-one-dollar-coin-us-mint/</link><description>该硬币庆祝美国 250 岁生日，尽管联邦法律通常禁止在世总统出现在美国货币上。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2230626995-e1788379111565.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 20:34:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/trump-one-dollar-coin-us-mint/</guid></item><item><title>“我真是个傻瓜”：举报的诈骗金额达到创纪录的 159 亿美元，估计每年高达 5000 亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/scams-record-highs-us-victims/</link><description>前检察官兼非营利组织“三叶草行动”创始人艾琳·韦斯特表示，“骗局发生后发生的事情甚至可能比骗局本身更糟糕。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26244751227279-e1788378116934.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 20:31:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/scams-record-highs-us-victims/</guid></item><item><title>习近平与中东盟友培养关系，中国与埃及打造“软实力”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/china-soft-power-egypt-visit/</link><description>中国国家主席抵达埃及，以该地区的稳定者的形象出现，并与美国形成鲜明对比。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26244636175635-e1788377673423.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 20:26:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/china-soft-power-egypt-visit/</guid></item></channel></rss>